        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko uwo mukuru w’ingabo abishura ati: “Mbega mwibaza ko databuja yarungikiye ubutumwa shobuja wenyene? N’abo bari ku ruzitiro nibavyumve kuko nimutishikana, tuzobugariza mwicwe n’inzara n’inyota gushika aho murya umwanda mukuru wanyu, munywe n’umwanda mutoya wanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze uwo mukuru w’ingabo arahaguruka avuga n’ijwi rirenga mu Giheburayo ati: “Nimwumve ijambo ry’umwami ahambaye, ari we mwami w’i Ashuri! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avuze ngo: Ntimwemere ko Hezekiya abahenda. Ntashobora kubakiza ngo abakure mu kuboko kwanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntahave abahenda ngo mwizere ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ababwira ngo: ‘",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " azodukiza, ntazokwemera ko iki gisagara kigwa mu maboko y’umwami w’i Ashuri.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimwumvirize Hezekiya. Ibi ni vyo umwami w’i Ashuri abamenyesheje: Nimurondere amahoro mu kwishikana iwanje. Ni ho umwe wese muri mwebwe azorya ku nzabibu no ku nsukoni ziwe, akanywa no ku mazi y’iriba ryiwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gushika aho nzobatwarira mu gihugu kimeze nk’iki c’iwanyu, igihugu kirimwo ingano n’umuvinyu mushasha, igihugu cuzuye indya n’imizabibu, igihugu c’imyelayo n’ubuki; maze muzobaho, ntimuzopfa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ntimwumvire Hezekiya kuko azoba ariko arabahenda niyababwira ati: ‘",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " azoturokora.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega hari imana z’ihanga na rimwe zigeze zirokora igihugu cazo mu kuboko kw’umwami w’i Ashuri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega imana z’i Hamati n’i Arupadi ziri hehe? Imana z’i Sefaruvayimu, iz’i Hena no muri Iwa ziri hehe? Mbega zarakijije Samariya mu maboko yanje? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega mu mana zose z’ivyo bihugu, ni izihe zashoboye kubikiza ukuboko kwanje? None ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni we yokiza Yerusalemu mu maboko yanje?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
